{"name": "Bronzebeard's Tavern 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU ARE A TRAVELLING TAVERN KEEP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chaotic 1\u20138 player co-op tavern simulator where you travel across fantasy regions, master unfamiliar cuisines, and serve unpredictable customers under the guidance of legendary tavern mentors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>UP TO 8-PLAYER MULTIPLAYER!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run taverns together with your dwarven friends online<strong> (Best with 4 players)</strong>. Band together to keep your mentor's tavern alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/d5399422022109af4ddd9fb65c9a3fdf.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/d5399422022109af4ddd9fb65c9a3fdf.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/d5399422022109af4ddd9fb65c9a3fdf.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CUSTOMERS WITH BIG PERSONALITIES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve customers with not only big appetites, but big personalities! Every tavern attracts fresh faces, from regular goblins, to bomb-slinging tinkerers, to trash-swallowing frog riders, <strong>each one with unique needs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/0a1e58fc75181aeba3614b796e3a28e7.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/0a1e58fc75181aeba3614b796e3a28e7.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/0a1e58fc75181aeba3614b796e3a28e7.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TRAVEL ACROSS FANTASICAL REGIONS!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your journey will take you through a variety of<strong> different taverns</strong>, each with their own layouts, hazards, and way of doing things. From the goblin camps of Grubkeep, to the hostile Burning Ashlands.<br/>Every region will push your team to communicate, cooperate and <strong>conquer the chaos together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/8252e60acca7687f33cc02b9a8b38709.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/8252e60acca7687f33cc02b9a8b38709.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/8252e60acca7687f33cc02b9a8b38709.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MASTER NEW DISHES AND CUISINES!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every region has its <strong>own dishes and cooking styles</strong>. The same ingredients can turn into very different meals depending on who you're serving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/fdf5ff796343c570142a556690a213e9.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/fdf5ff796343c570142a556690a213e9.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/fdf5ff796343c570142a556690a213e9.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE STORY OF PAPA BRONZEBEARD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the<strong>\u00a0Bronzebeard\u00a0</strong>family as they travel the world,  in an <strong>all-new campaign</strong>. Learning under fabled Tavern Masters and gathering the skills it takes to open the legendary\u00a0<strong>Bronzebeard\u2019s Tavern.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/c1291619ac2a008c5bd3d614d4a352cd.poster.avif?t=1787185620\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/c1291619ac2a008c5bd3d614d4a352cd.webm?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/extras/c1291619ac2a008c5bd3d614d4a352cd.mp4?t=1787185620\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ENDLESS, CLASSIC BRONZBEARD'S FUN!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the original Bronzebeard\u2019s Tavern you know and love with its own <strong>Endless Mode</strong>, featuring every customer, region, and dish you can imagine in one session.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chaotic multiplayer tavern adventure for 1-8 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple levels with different tavern layouts across different biomes.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large cast of quirky and unpredictable customers to serve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dwarf Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throw customers and players to wherever you want</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "A chaotic 1\u20138 player co-op tavern simulator where you travel across fantasy regions, master unfamiliar cuisines, and serve unpredictable customers under the guidance of legendary tavern mentors.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4089520/a0ed7c86a2603cc1a850f95fdd4b25c6f60c3d2e/header.jpg?t=1787185620", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Dwarves", "Simulation", "Cooking", "Action", "Multiplayer", "Online Co-Op"], "developers": "Mermaid MenZ Games Limited", "publishers": "Mermaid MenZ Games Limited", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4089520", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "13 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/LCAtA1Oz67c", "first_seen": 1786579200.0, "review_rank": 108}